    {
      "bbox": [
        326,
        452,
        1248,
        563
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, There exists an office of the Department of City Planning known as the\nupper Manhattan Planning and Development Office, which has been serving the area\nbounded by 155th Street and Harlem River Drive on the north, the Harlem River in the\ncast, 96th Street and Cathedral Parkway on the south and the Hudson River on the west,\nand the Community Planning Boards 9, 10 and 11 located therein; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.2631,
          "min": -1.3022
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 95,
          "mean": -0.0044,
          "min": -0.3912
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 19050,
        "area_px": 104048,
        "density": 0.18309,
        "chars": 400,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 21.0
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        326,
        563,
        1248,
        716
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, It is necessary and desirable that the planning functions performed by said office including assisting in the selection of sites for residential projects and for city capital projects in or affecting the area, the preparation and coordination of special plans and studies, the preparation of the draft capital budget with respect to city capital projects for the area, and other planning activities necessary and desirable for the area, be continued and be expanded to better serve the communities and the Community Planning Boards within the area; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.2136,
          "min": -1.1627
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 95,
          "mean": -0.0069,
          "min": -0.6367
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 25170,
        "area_px": 142137,
        "density": 0.17708,
        "chars": 561,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 22.29
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        326,
        721,
        1248,
        855
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, It is necessary and desirable to coordinate within the Office of the Mayor the aforesaid planning functions and the activities of all city agencies with respect to the development, rehabilitation, and redevelopment of residential, commercial, industrial, cultural and civic functions in the area and to coordinate such functions and activities with those of private interests, community groups, public authorities and the state and federal governments; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.2179,
          "min": -1.2481
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0003,
          "min": -0.0003
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 80,
          "mean": -0.0052,
          "min": -0.3904
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 20590,
        "area_px": 125415,
        "density": 0.16417,
        "chars": 465,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 22.58
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        329,
        860,
        1248,
        995
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, In particular, there is a need to coordinate the activities of the aforesaid entities with respect to the development of 125th Street and adjacent areas into a major commercial and retail center, the timing, scope and nature of development within the Urban Renewal areas and the Neighborhood Preservation District within the area, the interfacing of educational, social welfare and cultural services and activities with physical development of the area; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.218,
          "min": -1.0781
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 88,
          "mean": -0.0029,
          "min": -0.1865
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 20311,
        "area_px": 125936,
        "density": 0.16128,
        "chars": 466,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 22.94
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        330,
        999,
        1248,
        1088
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, It is necessary and desirable to reconsider the existing zoning for the area in light of present and projected development conditions and, in particular, to consider the desirability of special zoning districts, air rights transfers and other contemporary zoning techniques.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 20,
          "mean": -0.2277,
          "min": -0.941
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0002,
          "min": -0.0002
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 49,
          "mean": -0.0019,
          "min": -0.079
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 12289,
        "area_px": 82325,
        "density": 0.14927,
        "chars": 283,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 23.03
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        330,
        1093,
        1248,
        1137
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Now, therefore, by virtue of the power vested in me as Mayor of The City of New York, it is hereby ordered as follows:",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2064,
          "min": -1.1424
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0004,
          "min": -0.0004
        },
        "text": {
