        376,
        1137,
        1251,
        1226
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Section 1. Upper Manhattan Planning and Development Office. There is established in the Executive Office of the Mayor the Upper Manhattan Planning and Development Office, which shall be headed by a Director of Upper Manhattan Planning and Development who shall be appointed by and serve at the pleasure of the Mayor.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.202,
          "min": -1.244
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
